# A 1 m cube around the origin: the top face in "top" (red), the others in "side" (grey).
mtllib cube.mtl
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 0.5 0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 0.5
v 0.5 -0.5 0.5
v 0.5 0.5 0.5
v -0.5 0.5 0.5
usemtl side
f 1 4 3 2
f 1 2 6 5
f 2 3 7 6
f 3 4 8 7
f 4 1 5 8
usemtl top
f 5 6 7 8
